abstract: "Installable Agent Skill, zero-dependency Node.js 18+ 3D/HUD CLI renderer, and interactive HTML5/OBS chroma-key studio for mapping any visual style or storyline into authentic 9:16 livestream camera perspectives, compiling clean-plate I2V/T2V prompts across Kling, Seedance, Hailuo, Wan, Sora, Veo, and Runway, linting 8 livestream drift gates, and compositing crisp Douyin, Kuaishou, TikTok Live, Instagram Live, and X/Periscope overlays."
